      "prompt": "Edit the supplied source photograph into Single Ink Editorial Poster / 高级单色印刷海报. Produce one complete portrait 3:4 image, at least 1086 by 1448 pixels.\nObserved source: 竖幅照片中，多片翠绿蕨叶由左下延伸至右上，最清晰的中上部叶片可见规则羽状小叶；后方灰色石墙有裂缝和粗糙纹理，前景少量叶片虚化，未见文字或水印。\nMedium: One-ink mechanical reproduction on neutral paper, with active negative space and asymmetric editorial typography.\nCreate one front-facing portrait 3:4 editorial poster; choose one recognizable subject from the supplied photograph.\nUse exactly one printing ink for imagery, letters and rules; use botanical green for this sample and neutral white paper.\nTranslate photographic tones through ink coverage, screened dots and exposed paper; never simulate monochrome with a translucent color wash.\nKeep the subject silhouette, internal identifying features and structural connections readable despite tonal simplification.\nReserve approximately one third of the page as open paper; arrange image and type around one asymmetric focal event.\nUse the supplied short title with strong serif display type and restrained monospaced support; do not invent dates or factual metadata.\nLet paper show through selected highlights, with slightly broken ink coverage and fine grain only inside printed areas.\nAlign supporting elements to a shared invisible edge; allow one deliberate offset while leaving the main subject unobstructed.\nKeep the page clean and flat, without a room mockup, heavy distress, external frame, decorative stickers or watermark.\nPreserve: Preserve the source subject and its defining contours; limited editorial cropping must not remove identifying features. Keep attachment and overlap relationships intelligible; change reproduction and placement rather than inventing objects. Use supplied text verbatim when present; sample wording is not mandatory for future inputs.\nAvoid: Multiple ink hues, photo tinting, full-page colored haze or grayscale photography pasted onto a colored page. Unreadable subject, false captions, excessive noise, aged stains, decorative scrapbook clutter, mockup shadows or watermarks.\nSample text supplied for this example only: {\"title\":\"FERN STUDY\"}\nReturn only the finished image.",
